;; queryable via the kotoba API (SPARQL / Datalog).
;;
;; :part/procurement  :cots       — buy off-the-shelf (has :part/manufacturer + :part/purl)
;;                    :custom-fab — commission / fabricate (has :part/fab-process; no purl)
;; :part/sourcing     :representative — an R0 design selection, NOT a procurement-verified
;;                                      purchase decision. Treat manufacturer/MPN as
;;                                      defensible examples to be confirmed before buying.
;; :part/sim-feature  links the part to a render/collider feature_id in the sim
;;                    (giemon_kabitori.urdf / kami-app-giemon), where applicable.

